<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1PE" style="id">1PTLS-OMU SEBEZI NO KUTOLOKA EBIBELE NO SILUYANA</book>
  <para style="h">1Pitolosi</para>
  <para style="toc1">Elin̄olo lya Pitolosi no matatekelo</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Pitolosi</para>
  <para style="toc3">1Pit</para>
  <para style="mt2">ELIN̄OLO NO WELI LYA</para>
  <para style="mt1">PITOLOSI</para>
  <para style="imt">Okulimukisa</para>
  <para style="io1">Elin̄olo lya Pitolosi no weli kame lina kun̄oliwa kwa mutumiwa Pitolosi. Pitolosi kame atateka elin̄olo lyaye okwamba omo ana kwikala ni kwa woyo ana kun̄olela. Kame ana kun̄olela elin̄olo kwa sikupumena kwa Nyambe onje awo aisana nji “angenda” (1.1; 1.17) ni (2.11). Kame ana kwamba aanu aye asikubala awo mu nako yonje kame ahasanele mu tinaha tinjili. Kakuli elin̄olo eli kame liku fekile ni lin̄olo lya Paulusi ana kun̄olela ku Efese mu mikwa injili, ano kupula kame apumena nji elin̄olo no weli lya Pitolosi kame lina kun̄oliwa munyima no kun̄olela Amaifese mu myaka no kukwana makumi atanu ni likumi limweya ni tutanu munyima no kuleiwa kwa Kilesite. Pitolosi kame ana kun̄ola elin̄olo eli yoli mu Loma omo ana kwisananga nji Babiloni (5.13). Pitolosi kame aamba nji na kun̄ola elin̄olo eli mulibaka noku “misusuweza ni kupaka nji esi esishemo no niti sa Nyambe.” (5.12). Kweeli eyi no kupula eyo ikufekile mu 1 Pitolosi 2-11; 3.7; Maifese 5.18; 6.9 ni Makolose 3.18; 4.6. Etikalulo taatu eti tonje kame titalusa omo kufanenena okuyoyelwa mu umweya olusika ni kumamela etitukelo. Mane osisusuweza kame asikupumena nji akoongote aba kuli amayando kakuli amamaneneno sebeli ali beebi (4.1).</para>
  <para style="iot">Emitwi no Yambo.</para>
  <para style="ip">1. Pitolosi kame akutoloka yonyene ni kusimweta aye asikubala (1.1-2. 2). Cwale kame akutumela kwa Nyambe omo akutabela onje okuyoyisiwa neso sitalusa mulibaka no kuyoya koo (1.3; 2.10). 3. Esi sitatamako kame ataluseta asikupumena kwa Nyambe awo ali mu litunga omo afanenena okuyoyela wino ni kutalusa omuyoyelo oli mukaci ka mulume no kukwata ni mukati no kukwaliwa, mukaci ka mubika ni molyaye (2.1; 4.11). 4. Munyima nweyo, Pitolosi kame aasusuweza nji akoongote aba aingena mu mayando (4.12; 5.11). 5. Cwale kame ayatila elin̄olo lyaye (5.12-14).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1PE 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 1:1"/>Okutunda kwa Pitolosi omutumiwa wa Jesu Kilesite.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1PE 1:1">Kame nin̄olela awo ali mu ukoba ana hasanene mu tinaha no Pontusi, Magalata, Kapadosiya, Asiya ni Biteniya. <verse eid="1PE 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 1:2"/>Okuketiwa ni tumiwa kwa Nyambe Sitetu ni kukenisiwa ni Mebo mulibaka no likute kwa Jesu Kilesite ni mulibaka no kuwaiwa ni unyinga waye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1PE 1:2">Esishemo ni kozo iikale naanyi mukupula.<verse eid="1PE 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Esepo no Kuyoya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 1:3"/>Kulumbekwe Nyambe ni Sitaye Ombumu wetu Jesu Kilesite! Mulibaka no sishemo saye no kuneneba natuleiwa oubya mu sepo no kuyoya mu kwinguka kwa Jesu Kilesite okutunda kwaafu, <verse eid="1PE 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 1:4"/>mane nukayola oko no kwaabwa, okwasilafazwa ni koola eyo mutewelwe mu wilu. <verse eid="1PE 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 1:5"/>Awo mu maata a Nyambe kame musilelezwe mu tumelo mu kuyoyisiwa itatelele okumonisiwa mu nako no mamaneneno.<verse eid="1PE 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 1:6"/>Mwesi muwabelelwe simba nji mu nako icana abo memuyanda amayando no ukusiyasiya. <verse eid="1PE 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 1:7"/>Nji cwale okongola no tumelo yenu ni ya utokwa okubita egauda eyo ibwa aba yetekiwa mu mulilo imiwanise okuyemiwa ni kanya ni likute ba kumonahala kwa Jesu Kilesite. <verse eid="1PE 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 1:8"/>Kamwa simumona kame mumusinga, simba nji kamumumono bano kono kame mupumena mwa yonyene ni kuwabelelwa okuwabelewa no kuneneba no kwatalusiwa ni kanya. <verse eid="1PE 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 1:9"/>Eyi inatundu mu tumelo yenu na muwana okuyoyisiwa no myoyo yenu.<verse eid="1PE 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 1:10"/>Anuhi a Nyambe ana kunuha esishemo eso sina kufanena okutenda senu nasi kusaisisiwa ni kwibangutisisa eyi no kuyoyisiwa oko. <verse eid="1PE 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 1:11"/>Kame ana kusaisisisa nji kamunu simba enako eyo ina kumonisiwa ni Mebo ya Kilesite mukaci koo aba anakwamba amayando a Kilesite ni kanya yaye. <verse eid="1PE 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 1:12"/>Nai kumonisiwa kwa onyene nji kame ana kusebeza, kono kasa onyene kono anyi mu inu eyo inambiwa kwanyi okutunda kwawo ana kukutaza eliywi no kuwaba kwanyi mu Mebo no kukena inakutunda ku wilu. Einu eyo amangeloi anyolelwe okumona.<verse eid="1PE 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kame ami Isana nji Muyoye Omoyo no Kukena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 1:13"/>Cwalehe mukutatube eminahano yenu. mukuleme, mo mubeeka esepo yenu ba sishemo eso sikeyile kwaanyi ba kumonahala kwa Jesu Kilesite. <verse eid="1PE 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 1:14"/>Kanyi anu no likute, mulese okuukela kwiinu no kwiiba eyo muna kutendanga kunyima. <verse eid="1PE 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 1:15"/>Kono woyo ona kumiisana wakukena, cwale naanyi mutende ano kukena mu inu yonje mutenda. <verse eid="1PE 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 1:16"/>Kanyi omo kun̄olelwe nji, “Mba mukene kakuli ni mene nili wa kukena.” <verse eid="1PE 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 1:17"/>Cwale nji kame muisana Sitenu woyo watula aanu onje okuulwile esaluluti okukumnena ni tikezo taya, cwale muku babalele mwenyene mukucila enako yonje aba musiyoya. <verse eid="1PE 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 1:18"/>Mulimukile nji kame munakuliwa ku mikwa nambulwa tuso muna kuyola kwa njekulyenu kasa ni inu isinyeha kanyi Silibela ni gauda, <verse eid="1PE 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 1:19"/>kono cwale ni unyinga wa Kilesite no utokwa owo okufekile kanyi omukoko no kwanyazahala ni litilo. <verse eid="1PE 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 1:20"/>Kame abo elitunga elyaka sumbiwa kale kono kame ana kumonahala ku mamanenena no tinako mulibaka lyenu. <verse eid="1PE 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 1:21"/>Mwa yonyene kame muli ni sepo mwa Nyambe woyo ona kumwingula kwaafu ni kumuba ekanya nji cwale etumelo ni sepo yenu iikale mwa Nyambe.<verse eid="1PE 1:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 1:22"/>Cwale mukukenisiwa emyoyo yenu mulibaka no kukuteka eniti mu lilato musinge asikupumena, mukusinge omunjili ku munjili okutunda kunji no micima yenu. <verse eid="1PE 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1PE 1:23"/>Kame muna leiwa oubya kasa embuto eyo ifa kono eyo iyoya okubitela mu liywi lya Nyambe. <verse eid="1PE 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1PE 1:24"/>Kakuli</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 1:24">“Olutu lonje kame lukufekile kanyi moopu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 1:24">ni kanya yalo kame ikufekile kanyi epalisa no moopu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 1:24">Omopu kame ukukutanga ni tipalisa kame tikwanga, <verse eid="1PE 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1PE 1:25"/>kono eliywi lya Mbumu kame liikalelela okuta oku no kwabwa.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1PE 1:25">Eliywi elyo neli eliywi no kuwaba lina kukutaziwa kwaanyi.<verse eid="1PE 1:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1PE 2"/>
  <para style="s">Eliwee liyoya ni Anu no Kukena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 2:1"/>Mutundise omwiipo wonje, ni lunya, ni woongi ni muna mane ni kooba. <verse eid="1PE 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 2:2"/>Mukufeke kanyi anukana no kuleiwa abano, munyolelwe amawe no Mebo no kukena, mwa onyene kame samukule ni kuyoyisiwa. <verse eid="1PE 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 2:3"/>Kakuli namweteke esishemo sa Mbumu.<verse eid="1PE 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 2:4"/>Mwiiye kwa yonyene ku liwee no kuyoya lina kukaniwa kwaanu kono mu miyo a Nyambe nalikuketiwa mane lya utokwa. <verse eid="1PE 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 2:5"/>Naanyi ngeso, kanyi amawee no kuyoya mulesele amiyake okutenda endoo no Mebo okutenda oupulisita no kukena okuba eitabelo no Mebo eyo ipumeniwa kwa Nyambe mwa Jesu Kilesite. <verse eid="1PE 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 2:6"/>Kakuli mu lin̄olo kame ku n̄olilwe nji,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:6">Komumone, kame nilangeka eliwee mu Sione,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:6">(kanyi omusumu no lilulu) no kuketiwa ni utokwa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:6">mane woyo opumena mwa yonyene katamba kwenisiwa.<verse eid="1PE 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 2:7"/>Cwalehe kwanyi mu pumena niwa utokwa kono kwawo no kwapumena.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:7">Eliwee luli (Omusumo na mulilulu) elyo ana kukana ayaki</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:7">nalifutuka okutenda omutwi no utokwa.<verse eid="1PE 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 2:8"/>Cwale mu lin̄olo elinjili kame lyamba nji,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:8">“Eliwee elyo (musumo na mulilulu) sali sitatalise anu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:8">eliwee salyakwise</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1PE 2:8">kakuli kame asitatala mulibaka no kwakuteka eliywi kanyi omo ana kulaelelwa okutenda.<verse eid="1PE 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 2:9"/>Kono anyi kame muli olusika no kuketiwa, apulisita no umbumu, omushobo no kukena, aanu luli a Nyambe nji cwale mufanene okutenda einu no kuwaba ya woyo ona kumiisana okutunda ku uwi ni kuta mu liseli lyaye no kuwaba.<verse eid="1PE 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 2:10"/>Ba weli kame muna kwikalanga anu feela, kono bano sebeli muli anu a Nyambe, baweli kamwa sikutambula esishemo, kono bano namutambula esishemo.<verse eid="1PE 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Muyoye kanyi Abika a Nyambe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 2:11"/>Asingiwa kame nimi lemusa nji muli kame asikwenda mi muli angenda nji kame mutunda ku titakazo no lutu eto tilwisa omoyo yenu. <verse eid="1PE 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 2:12"/>Mutende ouwa mukaci no asimacama nji cwale simba nji kame amba eyi imilwisa kanyi asikutenda eino kwiiba, afanene okumona eyi no kuwaba eyo ikanyisa Nyambe ba liywaa saiye.<verse eid="1PE 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 2:13"/>Mukukokobeze mulibaka lya Mbumu ku maata anu onje, onene ku mubusisi mukulu, <verse eid="1PE 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 2:14"/>simba kwa busisi awo ana tumiwa kwa yonyene nji abe ekoto awo atenda eino kwiiba mane ni kuyeema awo atenda eino kuwaba. <verse eid="1PE 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 2:15"/>Kakuli ni mukusinga kwa Nyambe nji mukutenda eino kuwaba mwenise anu no aelo awo no kwalimuka esinjili. <verse eid="1PE 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 2:16"/>Muyoye kanyi aanu no kulukuluha, kono cwale mulese oukutusisa etukuluho yenu okutenda eyi no kwiiba, kono cwale muyoye kanyi abika a Nyambe. <verse eid="1PE 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 2:17"/>Mukuteke aanu onje, musinge akwenu asikupumena, mucile Nyambe mane mukuteke abusisi.<verse eid="1PE 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Omwanda no Mayando a Kilesite</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 2:18"/>Anyi abika mukubeke kunji no aolyenu ni likute lyonje, kasa fela kwawo akwite esishemo kono ni kwawo abambabile. <verse eid="1PE 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 2:19"/>Kakuli omunjili kame afuyauliwa nji kame atenda ya Nyambe, nji kame muyupa okukola simba nji kamusifosa. <verse eid="1PE 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 2:20"/>Kamubonda samu wane nji kame mutenda eyi no kwiiba mu kufuliwa mulibaka yalyo memukukokobeza? Kono nji kame mutenda eyi no kuwaba ni kwiyandisetwa muku kokobeze kakuli Nyambe na mifuyola. <verse eid="1PE 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 2:21"/>Kakuli mwesi namwisaniwa mulibaka lya Kilesite ona kumiyandele ngeso mi namisiyele omwanda nji mukon̄e emikwa yaye.<verse eid="1PE 2:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 2:22"/>Kasikutenda esibi mi kakwisa okoonga kuna kuwaniwa mu kwamba kwaye. <verse eid="1PE 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1PE 2:23"/>Aba ana kushubauliwa kasiku usa ouyi naba ana kuyandisiwa kasiku afumbela kono kame ana kusepa kwa Nyambe omwatuli no niti. <verse eid="1PE 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1PE 2:24"/>Kilesite luli nakushimba eibi yetu mu lutu lwaye ba sifapano, nji tufe ku sibi ni kuyoyela okuluka. Mulibaka no itombo yaye namu balisiwa. <verse eid="1PE 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1PE 2:25"/>Kakuli kame muna kwikala kanyi omukoko, kono bano namuusiwa ku Mulisana ni mubabaleli no myoyo yenu.<verse eid="1PE 2:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1PE 3"/>
  <para style="s">Akati noku Kwaliwa na Lume noku Kwata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 3:1"/>Mumukwa mumweya, anyi akati mukukokobeze kwa mbumwenu, nji cwale anjili simba kaakuteke amaywi kame saakome okulwile eliywi mulibaka no mikwa ya amoyoo, <verse eid="1PE 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 3:2"/>aba samone emikwa yenu no likute ni kuluka. <verse eid="1PE 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 3:3"/>Ouwa wenu ulese okutunda kuinu eyi, okukabisa etin̄uki, simba etinyuma no gauda nuukufuka eikumango no kuwaba. <verse eid="1PE 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 3:4"/>Kono mulese omumu woyo oshwekilwe mu micima yenu eyo no kwasinyeha ni kuwaba no mebo yondokile, eyo no utokwa mu miyo a Nyambe. <verse eid="1PE 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 3:5"/>Cwale mu tinako na kunyima akati no kukena awo ana kusepa mwa Nyambe kame ano kutendanga okuwaba nu kukokobeza kwa mbumoo. <verse eid="1PE 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 3:6"/>Kanyi Sala aba ana kukuteka Abulahama ni kumwisananga nji mbumu. Cwale bano muli anaye nji kame mutenda eyi no kuwaba mi kakwisa eso sasi micilise.<verse eid="1PE 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 3:7"/>Mu mukwa mumweya, naanyi alume no kukwata muyoye wino na moywenu me mulimukile nji amoywenu akufokola. Kakuli kame mukuwanine mu sishemo no moyo nji cwale etitapelo tenu tilese okukwangwisiwa ku sinjili.<verse eid="1PE 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Amayando mulibaka no Kutenda eyi no Kuluka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 3:8"/>Muku manenena, moonje mukuyupe mu mebo ni makeke, mukusinge mukaci kenu ni mucima no kuwaba ni minahano no kukokobeza. <verse eid="1PE 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 3:9"/>Mulese okuusa ouyi ku uyi simba okukuta, kono anyi mufuyole kakuli okufuyola kwana kumisepisa Nyambe aba ana kumiisana nji mutambule embuyoti.<verse eid="1PE 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 3:10"/>Kakuli</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 3:10">“Woyo osinga omoyo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:10">ni kumona amaywaa no kuwaba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:10">atundise olulimi lwaye kwiinu no kwiiba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:10">ni kanwa kaye okwamba eyi no mapwa.<verse eid="1PE 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 3:11"/>Kame afanena okutunda kweyi no kwiiba nji atenda eyi no kuwaba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:11">ni kusaela ekozo ni kwitundamena.<verse eid="1PE 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 3:12"/>Kakuli amiyo a Mbumu kame aliketa awo no kuluka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:12">mane amatwi aye kame ayupa etitapelo too,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:12">kono olubala lwa Nyambe kalusingi awo atenda eyi no kwiiba.”<verse eid="1PE 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 3:13"/>Cwale anyine so miyupisa okukola nji kame moongotite okutenda eino kuwaba? <verse eid="1PE 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 3:14"/>Kono simba nji kame muyandisiwa mulibaka no kuluka, mba mufuyoliwa, cwale mulese okwacila simba okubilaela. <verse eid="1PE 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 3:15"/>Kono mu micima yenu mu kuteke Kilesite kanyi Ombumu. Enako yonje mukutukisete oukusileleza ku munu yonje woyo weteka esepo ili mwaanyi, cwale mutende mu kusepa ni likute, <verse eid="1PE 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 3:16"/>cwale muteule elizwalo lyenu wino, nji cwale aba mu foseziwa, awo aamba eyi no kwiiba ku mikwa yenu no kuwaba mwa Kilesite mba enisiwa. <verse eid="1PE 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 3:17"/>Kakuli kwa kuwaba okuyanda okutenda eyi no kuluka, nji omo mwa singela Nyambe okubita okutenda ouyi. <verse eid="1PE 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 3:18"/>Kakuli Kilesite nakufa kamweya fela ngeso mulibaka no ibi mi woyo no kuluka kwawo ano kwaluka nji atulite kwa Nyambe nakwibaiwa ku lutu kono nakuyoyisiwa mu Mebo, <verse eid="1PE 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 3:19"/>omo ana kuta nukakutaza ku mebo ili mu tolongo. <verse eid="1PE 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 3:20"/>Eyo ina kukwangwa okukuteka abo okutatelela kwa Nyambe esitatelela mu maywaa a Nuwe, mu nako no kuyaka aleka omo anyonyo fela neli aanu nokukwana atanu ni twaatu ana kuyoyisiwa ku meyi, <verse eid="1PE 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 3:21"/>neli ekolobezo ilumelelana kwesi, bano kame imiyoyisa kasa okutundisa elitilo na balutu kono neli okukumbela kwa Nyambe mulibaka no lizwalo no kukena mu kwingulwa kwa Jesu Kilesite,<verse eid="1PE 3:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 3:22"/>woyo ana kuta mu wilu mi kame ali ku lyooko no silyo lya Nyambe ni mangeloi, ni titukelo ni maata anabiwi kwa yonyene.<verse eid="1PE 3:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1PE 4"/>
  <para style="s">Okufutuka Akayoyelo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 4:1"/>Cwalehe okumona nji Kilesite naku yandisiwa mu lutu, mukutukisete naanyi ni muhupulo umweya, kakuli woyo yonje ona yanda mu lutu natundisiwa mu sibi. <verse eid="1PE 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 4:2"/>Cwale mu kuyoya mu nako yonje mu lutu kasa mutitakazo no unu kono mulibaka no kusinga kwa Nyambe. <verse eid="1PE 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 4:3"/>Namu kuyoya mu nako no kuleba kanyi asimacaba omo ana kutendela no kwalimuka Nyambe. Okuyoya mu uhule, etitakazo no kwiiba, outahwa, emiikalelo no kwiiba mane ni kulapela emilimu no mapwa. <verse eid="1PE 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 4:4"/>Cwale asimacaba kame akomokile nji bano kamu kuwana noo mukutenda eyi no kwiiba mane kame aminyefula. <verse eid="1PE 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 4:5"/>Kono kame sakutambwele kwa Nyambe woyo okutukisete okwatula asikuyoya na sikufa. <verse eid="1PE 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 4:6"/>Kakuli elibaka elyo linakukutalezwa eliywi no kuwaba simba kwaafu, nji kame satuliwe mu lutu kanyi anu, kame sayoye mu Mebo kanyi Nyambe.<verse eid="1PE 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Aanu awo Ateula wino Etimpo ta Nyambe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 4:7"/>Cwale amamaneneno no inu yonje sebeli ali bebi. cwalehe mutukufalelwe mane mwikale nukulema mu titapelo tenu. <verse eid="1PE 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 4:8"/>Beulu no inu yonje esinu sinene ninji, mukoongote mu lilato lyenu ku munjili ni munjili, kakuli elilato kame lifuka eibi no kupula. <verse eid="1PE 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 4:9"/>Mutambule anu mu tindoo tenu mi mulese okubilaela. <verse eid="1PE 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 4:10"/>Omunjli ni munjili natambula empo, cwale mwibelekise kwa kwenu kanyi omubeleki no kuwaba no sishemo sa Nyambe eso siiya mu mikwa no kupula. <verse eid="1PE 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 4:11"/>Woyo yonje wamba kanyi woyo okutaza amaywi a Nyambe, woyo yonje osebeza, asebeze mulibaka no maata anabiwi kwa Nyambe, nji mu inu yonje Nyambe akanyisiwe mwa Jesu Kilesite, kwa yonyene kame kuli ekanya ni maata mu nako yonje. Ameni.<verse eid="1PE 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Okuyanda kanyi Osikupumena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 4:12"/>Asingiwa, mulese kukomoka ku miliko eyo imiyela mu kumyeteka kanyi ni sinu no ubya sitendahala mukaci kenu. <verse eid="1PE 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 4:13"/>Kono cwale muwabelelwe kakuli kame mukutabela amayando a Kilesite, nji cwale mukawabelelwe ni kunyakalala ngeso aba saimonahale ekanya yaye. <verse eid="1PE 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 4:14"/>Nji kame munyefuliwa mulibaka no litina lya Kilesite, namu fuyolwa kakuli emebo no kanya ni ya Nyambe kame ili beulu yenu. <verse eid="1PE 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 4:15"/>Kono kuulwe mukaci kenu woyo so yandisiwa kanyi omwibayi, simba ombuyi simba osikutenda eyi no kwiiba, simba woyo nokwa kukuteka. <verse eid="1PE 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 4:16"/>Kono nji omunjili kwanyi kame ayandisiwa mulibaka no asikupumena, alese kweena, kono munji no litina elyo akanyise Nyambe.<verse eid="1PE 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 4:17"/>Enako naiyi no katulo okutateka nasindoo ya Nyambe mi cwale nji kame saitateke kwaaci, ngasibine sakutendahale kwaawo nokwa kuteka eliywi no kuwaba lya Nyambe? <verse eid="1PE 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 4:18"/>Cwale,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 4:18">“Nji omunu no kuluka kame sayoyisiwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 4:18">kubine sakamonahalele woyo no kutenda eyi no kwiiba?”<verse eid="1PE 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 4:19"/>Cwalehe mulese awo ayanda okukumanena ni kusinga kwa Nyambe atende eyi no kuwaba ni kubeeka emyoyo yoo ku Muumbi woo no kusepahala.<verse eid="1PE 4:19"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1PE 5"/>
  <para style="s">Omutapi wa Nyambe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 5:1"/>Cwale kame nikumbela akulu mukaci kenu kanyi omukwenu mukulu. Kame nili opaki no mayando a Kilesite mane kame nili omunjili nwawo saka waniwe mu kanya eyo sai monahale. <verse eid="1PE 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 5:2"/>Mulise omutapi wa Nyambe, owo omusebezi munabiwi. Kasa muku kandimekwa kono mu kusinga, kasa wa mbango kono mutakazo. <verse eid="1PE 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 5:3"/>Mulese okweteka okuhapa awo ali mu pabalelo yenu, kono mutende omwanda ku mutapi. <verse eid="1PE 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 5:4"/>Mi cwale Omulisana omukulu aba samonahale, mba mubiwi omushukwe no kwabwa ekanya.<verse eid="1PE 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 5:5"/>Mundila imweya naanyi anukana muku kokobeze kwa kulu. Muku babalele mwenyene monje mukutuse omunjili ku munjili kakuli kame kwambiwa nji, “Nyambe kame akanena awo akukumusa, kono kame aba esishemo kwawo akukokobeza.” <verse eid="1PE 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 5:6"/>Cwalehe muku kokobeze mwenyene munji no maata no lyooko lya Nyambe, nji cwale mu nako ilukele mbamikulisa. <verse eid="1PE 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 5:7"/>Mubeeke etipilaelo tenu kwa yonyene, kakuli kame amibabalela.<verse eid="1PE 5:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 5:8"/>Mukuleme mi mutone! Omolyenu Diyabulosi kame abenabena kanyi ndee obenabena okusaela omunu saleme. <verse eid="1PE 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 5:9"/>Mumukanene mi mongole mu tumelo yenu me mulimukile nji amayando muyoya kame akufekile naabenu awo ali mu litunga lyonje. <verse eid="1PE 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 5:10"/>Cwale munyima no kuyanda kanyonyo, Nyambe no sishemo sonje woyo ona kumiisanena ku kanya yaye no kwaabwa mwa Kilesite, yonyene luli mba mitende ano kupetahala, okumyongota, mi mbamibi amata ni matatekelo.<verse eid="1PE 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 5:11"/>Kwa yonyene kwikale amaata no kwaabwa. Ameni<verse eid="1PE 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Okulumelisa no Mamaneneno</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 5:12"/>Mulibaka lya Silubenasi omunu no kusepahala kanyi aba nina mushimbi. Kame nina min̄olele eli lin̄olo mukwiibiba okumyongota mane ni kwamba nji esi esishemo no niti sa Nyambe. Mwimane mukoongola mwa sonyene.<verse eid="1PE 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 5:13"/>Ekeleke eyi ili mu Babilona ina kuketiwa kwa Nyambe, ni yonyene kame imikeeta bamweya ni mwanange Maleka. <verse eid="1PE 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 5:14"/>Mukukeete omunjili ku munjili mu ukutubeta no lilato.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1PE 5:14">Ekozo iikale kwaanyi monje anyi muli mwa Kilesite.<verse eid="1PE 5:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 5"/>
</usx>
